// k2StrMethod2 is ktStrMethod2 (jsrtkotlin.go:2209): the rest of the
// kotlin.text String surface - the CHAR-valued members (Kotlin's String is a
// sequence of Char, so first/last/get/single answer a Char and never a
// one-character String), the trimming and padding family, and the char-sequence
// operations that make a String behave like a collection.
